KS app-routing&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=26;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="t1"><mxGeometry x="2327.0" y="1902.0" width="185" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t1-c252" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/security/Key_Vaults.svg;" vertex="1" parent="t1"><mxGeometry x="2488.0" y="1907.0" width="18" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t1-c253" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Storage (documents)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;shared keys OFF, ZRS&lt;br&gt;versioning + soft delete&lt;br&gt;infra double encryption&lt;br&gt;Blob Data Contributor: app&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=26;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="t1"><mxGeometry x="2520.0" y="1902.0" width="185" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t1-c254" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/storage/Storage_Accounts.svg;" vertex="1" parent="t1"><mxGeometry x="2681.0" y="1907.0" width="18" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t1-c255" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Azure AI Search&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;keys OFF, 3 replicas (SLA)&lt;br&gt;own MI -&amp;gt; blob, AOAI&lt;br&gt;Index Data Reader: app&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=26;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="t1"><mxGeometry x="2134.0" y="2070.0" width="185" height="